{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Under the Influence felt like a natural next choice because I wanted more Straight No Chaser after The New Old Fashioned; It's Entertainment appealed for the same reason.",
    "PTXmas and the other Christmas albums fit my earlier holiday listening, so those suggestions reflected a real interest even though I would save them for another time."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Elvis album's orchestral element was not enough to interest me because I was looking to continue with Straight No Chaser, not explore Elvis recordings.",
    "Vocal harmonies alone did not make the Boyz II Men collection appealing, while titles such as Heritage and His Love Remains gave me too little evidence of a match."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My older Christmas listening seemed to carry too much weight in deciding what I would want now.",
    "Shared vocal or orchestral qualities seemed to be treated as enough of a connection, even when the performer or type of album did not appeal to me."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest choice made me more interested in another Straight No Chaser album than in returning immediately to Christmas music.",
    "I rarely choose much at once: several albums can fit my interests while only one feels compelling enough to try today."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognized my holiday and vocal music interests, but gave too little weight to my current wish to follow up on Straight No Chaser."
}"}
